ECHO C6 FMTCORE >> BUILD.LOG
CL /nologo /c /G0 /Gw /Gs /AS /W3 /Od FMTCORE.C >> BUILD.LOG
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
ECHO C6 VGM >> BUILD.LOG
CL /nologo /c /G0 /Gw /Gs /AS /W3 /Od VGM.C >> BUILD.LOG
