C:\BIN\LINK4 /NOE /NOD @MINIPLAY.RSP >> BUILD.LOG
IF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO FAIL
ECHO PASS NATIVE PLAYER BUILD >> BUILD.LOG
GOTO END
:FAIL
ECHO FAIL NATIVE PLAYER BUILD >> BUILD.LOG
:END
